title: '[[id:8910393c-e7f6-4f29-9d64-6cd3a26eba85][A link''s words are all a reader has to decide whether to follow it, so a link titled with a topic''s name sends nobody, and one titled with a claim does.]]'
pid: 4df46485-d37f-49ef-98c9-3fa001ec5229
body: |2-
  Information foraging theory's "scent", seen in Jeff's hub notes; and
  why a link annotated "missing" misled me.
